Capability sentinel for the desired-state-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/desired-state
through the real ptah-compat CLI. It exercises the Atlas desired-state source
model Ptah implements for `schema diff`, `schema apply`, and `migrate diff`
(stokaro/ptah#811, stokaro/ptah#842): live database URLs, an atlas.sum-covered
migration directory replayed on a dev database, env:// references resolved
through an evaluated atlas.hcl environment, validated migrate-diff artifact
replay and convergence, and desired/dev path-alias rejection before source
mutation or artifact creation. All databases are ephemeral SQLite files in the
scratch run directory.
